72\n\nSum of refunds:\n-257.97 - 837.46 = -1095.43\n-1095.43 - 656.32 = -1751.75\n-1751.75 - 459.90 = -2211.65\n-2211.65 - 775.00 = -2986.65\n-2986.65 - 775.10 = -3761.75\n-3761.75 - 173.82 = -3935.57\n-3935.57 - 247.18 = -4182.75\n-4182.75 - 207.83 = -4390.58\n-4390.58 - 115.72 = -4506.30\n\nSo total refunds = -4506.30\n\nNet balance = 7188.10 - 4506.30 = 2681.80\n\nLet me verify this calculation again:\n\n7188.10 - 4506.30 = 2681.80\n\nYes, the net balance is 2681.80.\n", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"type": "function", "function": {"name": "submit_answer", "arguments": "{\"answer\":\"2681.80\"}"}, "id": "ePNk6obggUP89YvYs1G9EwYiG083uDdi"}]}, {"tool": "submit_answer", "result": {"ok": true}}], "grade": {"functional": false, "state_ok": true, "answer_ok": false, "process_ok": true, "submitted": 1, "update_batches": 0, "full_pass": false, "answer": "2681.80", "expected_answer": "10130.68", "wrong_changes": []}}